  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fL3F/28",
  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size26\"><b>에라토스테네스의&#160;지구크기&#160;측정&#160;방법으로&#160;</b><br><b>실제&#160;지구&#160;크기&#160;측정하기</b><br><b>(전국단위&#160;실험&#160;베타테스트)</b><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>1. 전국 단위 실험을 하기 위한 테스트<br>&#160;<br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">2025년 3월9일 오전 11시23분</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">서울 서대문구 북가좌동 어느 곳에서</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">수평자로 중력에 수직으로 세웁니다.</span><br>&#160;<br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">아래 사진처럼</span></span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8fbd36c5556b6acc7cb1d299d455cbbc19429df0\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8fbd36c5556b6acc7cb1d299d455cbbc19429df0\" data-origin-width=\"900\" data-origin-height=\"1200\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9b96773e321a8b8fe30dd47c38b178f574c16311\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9b96773e321a8b8fe30dd47c38b178f574c16311\" data-origin-width=\"900\" data-origin-height=\"1200\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b>그림자의 정 반대 방향에 누군가 서 있습니다.</b></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0c3123c578b08070267bb23d41348436188a564f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0c3123c578b08070267bb23d41348436188a564f\" data-origin-width=\"900\" data-origin-height=\"675\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/130c63fcd3f3f9fa01e2a1124a71f5c3f7b35f68\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/130c63fcd3f3f9fa01e2a1124a71f5c3f7b35f68\" data-origin-width=\"900\" data-origin-height=\"1200\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d81965fb8dd174f8846bbbd4e3488e628360740e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d81965fb8dd174f8846bbbd4e3488e628360740e\" data-origin-width=\"900\" data-origin-height=\"1200\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/676772512cecfc174d3ccc92bae0f1ce7b3aa4e2\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/676772512cecfc174d3ccc92bae0f1ce7b3aa4e2\" data-origin-width=\"900\" data-origin-height=\"1200\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">그림자의 정 반대 방향은 남남동 방향입니다.</span></b><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">서울에서 남남동 방향에는 어느 도시가  있을까요?</span></b><br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/52c0ea9b326e3d645c672c4cd31f2c7fb854544b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/52c0ea9b326e3d645c672c4cd31f2c7fb854544b\" data-origin-width=\"900\" data-origin-height=\"1200\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f75aecfccab9bbc72dc4f3757cfeca05b5329de2\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f75aecfccab9bbc72dc4f3757cfeca05b5329de2\" data-origin-width=\"900\" data-origin-height=\"1200\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7dedd361556ad03afa18f4e8f9ef02e387f47aaf\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7dedd361556ad03afa18f4e8f9ef02e387f47aaf\" data-origin-width=\"900\" data-origin-height=\"1200\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fca3837e893ea7794a9549b5acc2e4fdc2418cec\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fca3837e893ea7794a9549b5acc2e4fdc2418cec\" data-origin-width=\"900\" data-origin-height=\"1200\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size26\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">위 사진은 서울에서 실험한 사진</span><br>&#160;<br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">서울에서 측정한 값</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">막대의 길이 45.0cm</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">그림자의 길이 46.3cm</span><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">그림자의 정 반대 방향에는</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">경남 창원시 마산회원구 마산동중학교의 강인숙 선생님께서 서 계십니다.</span><br>&#160;<br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">그곳에서도</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">2025년 3월9일 11시23분</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">막대의 길이와 그림자의 길이를 측정합니다.</span></span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ad36bc51a95d900d33c4c607dea11c68530f4bb4\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ad36bc51a95d900d33c4c607dea11c68530f4bb4\" data-origin-width=\"900\" data-origin-height=\"1598\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4443253b3cfec74c32429fdf73e4c58ab2151e2d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4443253b3cfec74c32429fdf73e4c58ab2151e2d\" data-origin-width=\"900\" data-origin-height=\"1598\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3ea8047c70f35b82bd2c5911360f1c46af9e1123\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3ea8047c70f35b82bd2c5911360f1c46af9e1123\" data-origin-width=\"900\" data-origin-height=\"1598\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size26\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">위 사진은 마산에서 찍은 사진</span><br>&#160;<br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">마산에서 측정한 값</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">막대 길이 45.0cm</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">그림자의 길이 42.6cm</span><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">두 지점(서울-마산) 사이 거리</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">301.1km</span><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">오늘 측정한 값으로 </span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">계산을 통해</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">지구 반지름을 측정 </span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">계산 결과 7191km 이 나왔습니다.</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">오차가 좀 나오지요.</span><br>&#160;<br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">-그림자 방향이 같은 선상에 있으면 같은경도 아니어도 실험이 가능합니다.</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">&#160;따라서 지역마다 실험할 날마다 시각이 다릅니다.</span><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">2.&#160;</span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">위와 같은 실험을</span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">전국에 계시는 중학교 2학년 과학 선생님들과 함께 하고자 합니다.</span></b><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><span style=\"color: #000000;\">함께, </span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">실제 지구 크기 측정 실험을 하는 방법에 대한 글을 </span><br><span style=\"color: #000000;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">조만간</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"> 올리도록 하겠습니다. ^^</span><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;</span></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
